{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7JgmqBA1iY5oNGvBXZ4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before I draft, a few questions. Your answers will change what the pitch says:\n\n1. **Why did it close in 2022, and what makes it viable now?** Backers who remember the closure will want to know it won't happen again. Does a volunteer-run model with a $1 rent cover running costs at roughly 180 tickets a week?\n2. **What's different from the campaign three years ago?** I'd mention it openly, since many of your backers probably gave last time. Did the target drop from $120,000 to $85,000 because the scope changed, or because the lease deal or something else cut costs?\n3. **If you fall short, what happens to people's money?** Is this all-or-nothing with refunds again? And to confirm: the deadline is June 30, 2027, and the crowd needs to raise $60,000 to unlock the bank's $25,000?\n4. **What do backers get, and is there a typical amount you're hoping for?** For example ticket bundles, a name on a seat, or opening-night passes.\n5. **Is there one local story or voice we can use?** For example a longtime projectionist, a family that drives 76 miles round trip for a film, or a target reopening date.\n\nIf you don't know some of these, say so and I'll write the pitch without them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":244,"cache_read_input_tokens":9522,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":244},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6cf0d7c6-128c-4af1-8906-684958e6e040","uuid":"50bdbbc5-bf92-4b99-91aa-e0902fdb89ba","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:19:58.906Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7JgmiE6MduUAJapbwmN"}
