{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7JhzCqU8jXGTuDcpuxc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<final_document>\n**Bring the Majestic Back**\n\nThe one screen at the Majestic on Main Street has been dark since 2022. Today, seeing a movie in a theater means a 76-mile round trip.\n\nWe can change that by Thanksgiving.\n\n**The deal**\n\nThe building's owner has agreed to rent the Majestic to us for $1 a year for ten years. The condition is that we get it ready to open. That takes $85,000 for a new projector, a new sound system and a repaired roof.\n\nA local bank has pledged $25,000 of that. The bank's condition is that the town raises the other $60,000 by June 30.\n\n**Why this time is different**\n\nSome of you backed our campaign three years ago. It reached $47,000 of a $120,000 goal, and we returned every dollar, as we said we would. This campaign works the same way. It's all-or-nothing. If we don't reach $85,000 by June 30, every pledge comes back to you in full.\n\nThree things have changed. The goal is $35,000 lower. A bank has already committed a quarter of it. And there's a ten-year lease waiting for us.\n\nLast time, this town pledged $47,000. This time we need $60,000 from you, which is $13,000 more than you gave before.\n\n**Who will run it**\n\nForty-six of your neighbors have already signed up to run the box office and the snack bar. In its last days, the Majestic was still selling about 180 tickets a week, so the audience was there right up to the end.\n\n**What we're asking**\n\nPledge what you can by June 30. If you gave last time, please give again. If you didn't, this is the time. Then tell one person who misses Friday nights on Main Street.\n\nIf we reach the goal, the projector goes in, the roof gets fixed, and the lights come back on this Thanksgiving.\n\nThank you,\n\nRuth Albers\nChair, the volunteer group working to reopen the Majestic\n</final_document>\n\nThe pitch is 309 words. A few things to check before May 1:\n\n- **\"This Thanksgiving\":** this is accurate if the page goes live in 2027. Change it if the text will also be used somewhere else.\n- **Reward tiers:** once you've decided on them, add them under \"What we're asking.\" I left them out rather than make them up.\n- **Group name:** the sign-off uses a description in place of a name. Put in your group's official name if it has one.\n- **The bank:** if it's happy to be named, use its name. A named local bank is more convincing than \"a local bank.\"\n- **Running costs:** I didn't claim the Majestic will pay its own way, because you don't know that yet. Expect backers to ask. A short plan for covering running costs once it opens would be the most useful thing to add before launch, even a rough budget showing what $1 rent and volunteer staff save."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":909,"cache_read_input_tokens":9766,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":909},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6cf0d7c6-128c-4af1-8906-684958e6e040","uuid":"2b736343-0376-4e14-afb8-f042c382cfec","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:20:25.979Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7Jhz4uZGntQFMb4U7t1"}
